      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CREAM (6) has some solid form under her belt and proved too strong last time to win by 1.75 lengths at this track in a handy 20.25 beating Jayville Zoe. Has won two of four starts from this draw. The hardest to beat again. ASTON MAJOR (2) is having his first start around this track. Scored last start (17.17) at Healesville over 300m. One of main contenders. AUDACIOUS DODGE (1) doesn't win out of turn but looks close to breaking through. Has finished in the placings two on end now, the latest when second (20.77) at this track. Has performed well from this box with a win and three minor placings to her name from five starts. Well-placed to take this out. HIGH FINANCE (4) flew the lids and led all the way last time. Sure to figure prominently.",
